 "remarks": "Welcome home to this beautifully expanded Cape, perfectly positioned on a sought-after cul-de-sac. Completely renovated in 2021, this residence effortlessly blends timeless charm with a fresh, contemporary aesthetic. The heart of the home is a stunning open-concept living space where a chef-inspired kitchen takes center stage. Outfitted with crisp quartz countertops and a generous island with seating, flowing naturally into the dining area and sun-filled living room anchored by a cozy fireplace. During the cooler months, you'll enjoy the added bonus of winter water views of the Mianus River. Newly finished hardwood floors run throughout, adding warmth and continuity to the versatile layout. With five spacious bedrooms and two full baths, the floor plan offers incredible flexibility to suit your specific lifestyle needs. Step outside to the expansive deck, the perfect spot for al fresco dining or simply relaxing while overlooking the private, lush yard. This home offers a wonderful balance of tranquility and convenience, located just moments from a variety of local restaurants and shopping, with easy access to Metro North for a streamlined commute. It's a rare opportunity to move right into a turnkey home in a truly stellar setting.",
